 "description": "Everything DexScreener publishes for a single pool: the pair's chain, dex and label, price in USD and native, liquidity split, volume and buy/sell counts per window, and 5m/1h/6h/24h price change. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Byte-identical to GET /market/dex-pair-detail?chain=base&pair=0x5D0bC342178C8Fe2c2f9A9fcC9D52555C99936db.",
